0:{"buildId":"7TV3WSDnKGdgKVGmLMU3E","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Funding"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Scholarship Vs. Student Loan: Understanding The Pros And Cons"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"Deciding to study abroad is an exciting but daunting step, especially when it comes to sorting out the finances. Many students think about options like scholarships and student loans. In this guide, we’ll look closely at these choices, talking about their advantages and disadvantages. Studying in another country can be fantastic for your education and personal development. But let’s face it, it’s expensive. That’s where scholarships and loans come in handy. They both have their good and bad sides, which we’ll go over together. Scholarships"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","The guide",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The guide"}],[["$","p","A lot of people tend to be confused in understanding what scholarships are? However, it is a grant that the government, an NGO, or any other organization pays for. It can help the applicant focus on their goals more effectively and lessen the stress of financial issues. Under this, a grant or payment is given to a student to help pay for their studies, based on how well they do in their academics or in other areas of research.",{"children":"A lot of people tend to be confused in understanding what scholarships are? However, it is a grant that the government, an NGO, or any other organization pays for. It can help the applicant focus on their goals more effectively and lessen the stress of financial issues. Under this, a grant or payment is given to a student to help pay for their studies, based on how well they do in their academics or in other areas of research."}],["$","p","PROS",{"children":"PROS"}],["$","p","By funding all or a portion of your tuition, scholarships save you and your family money by reducing your financial burden.",{"children":"By funding all or a portion of your tuition, scholarships save you and your family money by reducing your financial burden."}],["$","p","Academic success, extracurricular involvement, and potential are frequently taken into account when awarding scholarships. Getting a scholarship is entirely up to the university, but it recognizes your hard work and ability.",{"children":"Academic success, extracurricular involvement, and potential are frequently taken into account when awarding scholarships. Getting a scholarship is entirely up to the university, but it recognizes your hard work and ability."}],["$","p","A few scholarships include networking opportunities that can help you meet important people in your profession and improve your chances of landing a job.",{"children":"A few scholarships include networking opportunities that can help you meet important people in your profession and improve your chances of landing a job."}],["$","p","Scholarships, in contrast to student loans, have no repayment obligations, so you can graduate debt-free.",{"children":"Scholarships, in contrast to student loans, have no repayment obligations, so you can graduate debt-free."}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22"],"$L23"]}]]}],"$L24"]}]}],"$L25"]}],["$L26"],"$L27"]}],"isPartial":"$@28","staleTime":"$29","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L2a","isPartial":"$@2b","staleTime":"$29","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L2c","isPartial":"$@2d","staleTime":"$29","varyParams":"$2e"},{"rsc":"$L2f","isPartial":"$@30","staleTime":"$29","varyParams":"$2e"},{"rsc":"$L31","isPartial":"$@32","staleTime":"$29","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@33","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@34"}
