5:["$","p","CONS",{"children":"CONS"}]
6:["$","p","Competitive:",{"children":"Competitive:"}]
7:["$","p","Many applicants compete fiercely for a small number of scholarships. It can be difficult to stand out among a crowd of exceptionally skilled applicants.",{"children":"Many applicants compete fiercely for a small number of scholarships. It can be difficult to stand out among a crowd of exceptionally skilled applicants."}]
8:["$","p","Strict Eligibility:",{"children":"Strict Eligibility:"}]
9:["$","p","Scholarships may have strict requirements for eligibility, which may limit the number of qualified candidates by evaluating things like GPA, country of origin, or subject of study.",{"children":"Scholarships may have strict requirements for eligibility, which may limit the number of qualified candidates by evaluating things like GPA, country of origin, or subject of study."}]
a:["$","p","Restricted Coverage:",{"children":"Restricted Coverage:"}]
b:["$","p","Although scholarships pay for tuition, they might not cover living expenses, travel expenses, or other ancillary charges.",{"children":"Although scholarships pay for tuition, they might not cover living expenses, travel expenses, or other ancillary charges."}]
c:["$","p","Not Guaranteed:",{"children":"Not Guaranteed:"}]
d:["$","p","It’s critical to keep in mind that scholarships are not assured, and getting one might be extremely challenging.",{"children":"It’s critical to keep in mind that scholarships are not assured, and getting one might be extremely challenging."}]
e:["$","p","Student Loans",{"children":"Student Loans"}]
f:["$","p","For studying abroad are financial products designed to help students cover the cost of education, living expenses, and other related costs while pursuing a degree outside their home country. These loans can come from various sources, including government programs, private lenders, and international organizations.",{"children":"For studying abroad are financial products designed to help students cover the cost of education, living expenses, and other related costs while pursuing a degree outside their home country. These loans can come from various sources, including government programs, private lenders, and international organizations."}]
10:["$","p","PROS",{"children":"PROS"}]
11:["$","p","Access to Funds:",{"children":"Access to Funds:"}]
12:["$","p","In order to pay for tuition and other expenditures without having to make an upfront payment, student loans offer instant access to funds.",{"children":"In order to pay for tuition and other expenditures without having to make an upfront payment, student loans offer instant access to funds."}]
13:["$","p","Flexible Repayment:",{"children":"Flexible Repayment:"}]
14:["$","p","With the support of many student loan repayment options, you can start making payments once you graduate and have a more steady job.",{"children":"With the support of many student loan repayment options, you can start making payments once you graduate and have a more steady job."}]
15:["$","p","Possibility of Higher Education:",{"children":"Possibility of Higher Education:"}]
16:["$","p","Due to financial limitations, student loans may make it possible to pursue higher education that may not have been possible earlier.",{"children":"Due to financial limitations, student loans may make it possible to pursue higher education that may not have been possible earlier."}]
17:["$","p","CONS",{"children":"CONS"}]
18:["$","p","Accrued Interest:",{"children":"Accrued Interest:"}]
19:["$","p","Over time, interest on student loans accrues, which could result in a larger total repayment amount than the original loan.",{"children":"Over time, interest on student loans accrues, which could result in a larger total repayment amount than the original loan."}]
1a:["$","p","Debt Responsibility:",{"children":"Debt Responsibility:"}]
1b:["$","p","After graduation, repaying student loans may result in a large debt load that limits your options and financial freedom.",{"children":"After graduation, repaying student loans may result in a large debt load that limits your options and financial freedom."}]
1c:["$","p","Uncertainty:",{"children":"Uncertainty:"}]
1d:["$","p","It may be difficult to make timely student loan repayment payments given the state of the economy and employment prospects following graduation.",{"children":"It may be difficult to make timely student loan repayment payments given the state of the economy and employment prospects following graduation."}]
1e:["$","p","Conclusion",{"children":"Conclusion"}]
1f:["$","p","Selecting between student loans and scholarships is a crucial decision that might influence your academic path and beyond. Every option has pros and cons, so it’s important to carefully assess your position and objectives before deciding.",{"children":"Selecting between student loans and scholarships is a crucial decision that might influence your academic path and beyond. Every option has pros and cons, so it’s important to carefully assess your position and objectives before deciding."}]
20:["$","p","We at",{"children":"We at"}]
21:["$","p","One Window",{"children":"One Window"}]
22:["$","p","are committed to giving you the direction and encouragement you need to make the right decision for your future, thanks to our skilled advisers. To confidently begin this life-changing journey, get in touch with us right now.",{"children":"are committed to giving you the direction and encouragement you need to make the right decision for your future, thanks to our skilled advisers. To confidently begin this life-changing journey, get in touch with us right now."}]
23:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Financial Relief:",{"children":"Financial Relief:"}],["$","li","Merit Recognition:",{"children":"Merit Recognition:"}],["$","li","Networking Possibilities:",{"children":"Networking Possibilities:"}],["$","li","No Repayment Requirement:",{"children":"No Repayment Requirement:"}]]}]
